{#- The tools that follow the reader over a veil: when a modal holds the page,
    its chat is out of reach under the veil, so the tools marked for it
    (`overlay: true` in layout_dock_tools) stand again at the window's end,
    over the veil — a dock of the overlay layer, with its own state. Shown
    while a modal or a panel holds the page (`has-overlay-backdrop` and
    `data-overlay-kind`, OverlayService), not over a veil that only waits for
    a page to load; what it opens
    pushes the modal aside (`--overlay-aside`). -#}
<div class="overlay-tools zone--split zone--split--joined" data-overlay-rise>
    {{ tool_dock('overlay', tools, { class: 'tool-dock--overlay' }) }}
</div>
